        "rules": [
          {
            "name": "Dark Energy",
            "id": "303f-3b06-35c3-70df",
            "description": "Activation: 10 / Strain: 1 / Line of Sight\nThe figure makes a +5 Shooting attack against any target within 12”. This attack ignores any armour worn by a figure (so subtract a figure’s armour 1modifier from their armour). Increase this attack to +7 against robots. If this attack targets a figure in combat, do not randomize the target, it can only hit the intended target. (Armour Interference).",
            "hidden": false
          }
        ]
      },
